come from the lib files of the TypeScript compiler that read the declarations
(npm package typescript@5.9.3), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The artifact names each source with its exact version and integrity, and each
fact cites the file and line it was read from. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt carries
the licence and notices of each source, as they ship them.
